{%- comment -%}
  Prints text, turning anything in [square brackets] into a dashed "fill in" tag,
  so the page shows clearly what Kiki still needs to give you.
  Usage: {% render 'fill-text', text: block.settings.text %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{{- text | escape | replace: '[', '<span class="fill">' | replace: ']', '</span>' | newline_to_br -}}
